            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Patiganita, a book written by Sridharacharya in the 9th century C.E., mentions this problem: “Friend, after thinking, what sum will be obtained by adding together",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\div \\frac{1}{6}, 1 \\div \\frac{1}{10}, 1 \\div \\frac{1}{13}, 1 \\div \\frac{1}{9},"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\div \\frac{1}{2} ''"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". What should the friend say?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.18,
            0.208,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 40"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.223,
            0.883,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mira is reading a novel that has 400 pages. She read",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "of the pages yesterday and",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 1 0 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "of the pages today. How many more pages does she need to read to finish the novel? Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 200 pages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.343,
            0.883,
            0.415
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. A car runs 16 km using 1 litre of petrol. How far will it go using "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 ~ \\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "litres of petrol? Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 44 km."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.437,
            0.881,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Amritpal decides on a destination for his vacation. If he takes a train,",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " it will take him "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\frac { 1 } { 6 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "hours to get there. If he takes a plane, it will take him",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "hour. How many hours does the plane save? Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 4 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hour"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.568,
            0.881,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mariam’s grandmother made a cake. Mariam and her cousins finished",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{4}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "of the cake. The remaining cake was shared equally by Mariam’s three friends. How much of the cake did each friend get? Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 1 5 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of the whole cake."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.69,
            0.767,
            0.742
          ],
          "content": [
